 "name_en": "Interest Rate Derivatives Management (1X3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Interest Rate Derivatives Management (1X3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The interest rate derivatives management process helps you to manage your interest rate risks. The functionality helps you to automate labor-intensive processes, such as confirmation of financial transactions and accounting postings, giving you more time to focus on value-added activities.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process includes the products interest rate swaps (payer, receiver, and basis), and cross-currency interest rate swaps (payer, receiver, and basis).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create financial transactions (interest rate swaps / cross currency interest rate swap)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate confirmations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer values to general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform month-end accounting processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust variable interests</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate and post realized profit and loss</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor and report on positions, postings and risk key figures</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the management of interest swaps, including the creation of financial transactions, periodic activities (such as interest rate adjustments and payments), and accounting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make better operational and strategic decisions using the comprehensive reporting and analysis tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve internal operational compliance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>利率衍生工具管理 (1X3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">利率衍生工具管理流程可帮助您管理利率风险。此功能可帮助您自动化劳动密集型流程（例如确认金融交易和会计过账），为您提供更多时间来关注增值活动。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程包括产品利率掉期（付款方、接收方和基础）和交叉货币利率互换（付款方、接收方和基础）。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建金融交易（利率互换/交叉货币利率互换）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将值传输到总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行月末会计流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">调整可变利息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算并过账已实现的损益</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控并报告头寸、过账和风险关键指标</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio72e2fcb675184178943371e95c8f5d89__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动管理利率掉期，包括创建金融交易、定期活动（例如利率调整和付款）和会计核算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用全面的报表和分析工具，制定更明智的运营和战略决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高内部运营合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
